            <div class="impl-phase-desc">Deploy on a single product with limited case volume. Validate extraction accuracy and HITL workflows.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="impl-phase">
            <div class="impl-phase-num">Phase 2</div>
            <div class="impl-phase-name">UAT & Validation</div>
            <div class="impl-phase-dur">6–8 weeks</div>
            <div class="impl-phase-desc">Formal IQ/OQ/PQ testing. GAMP 5 documentation. CSV/CSA qualification. 21 CFR Part 11 compliance review.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="impl-phase">
            <div class="impl-phase-num">Phase 3</div>
            <div class="impl-phase-name">Production</div>
            <div class="impl-phase-dur">Ongoing</div>
            <div class="impl-phase-desc">Full deployment across product portfolio. Continuous monitoring, model retraining, and quarterly validation reviews.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── VENDOR LANDSCAPE ─────────────────────────────────── -->
