        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(241,236,224,0.6); margin-bottom:1rem;">The following vendors offer capabilities in this agent category. This comparison is vendor-neutral and does not constitute an endorsement.</p>
        <table class="vendor-table">
